iqrs is a Rust reimplementation of part of IsoQuant 4.1 (transcript discovery and
quantification for bulk long-read RNA-seq). Its algorithms, parameters and output formats
follow the IsoQuant 4.1.0 source code, and it is distributed under the same license, the
GNU General Public License, version 2 (see LICENSE).

