Bundled third-party data
------------------------
crates/iq_terminal/data/model_polya.json and crates/iq_terminal/data/model_tss.json are the
polyA-site and TSS XGBoost models shipped with IsoQuant 4.1.0
(isoquant_lib/data/model_polya.json and model_tss.json), copied unmodified and embedded in the
iqrs binary. They are part of IsoQuant and covered by its copyright and license.

The statically linked Linux (musl) release binaries include mimalloc
(https://github.com/microsoft/mimalloc), Copyright (c) 2018-2025 Microsoft Corporation and
Daan Leijen, MIT license, through the Rust `mimalloc` crate (MIT).

